WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.836 --> 00:00:12.497
walked into the mess hall for lunch.

2
00:00:15.198 --> 00:00:18.459
Ezra and Glen looked surprised when she got into the food line with them.

3
00:00:18.479 --> 00:00:21.060
"You're out of the infirmary!"

4
00:00:21.441 --> 00:00:22.061
Glen said.

5
00:00:22.081 --> 00:00:23.622
"This is great!"

6
00:00:24.542 --> 00:00:25.342
"What happened?"

7
00:00:25.682 --> 00:00:26.363
Ezra asked.

8
00:00:26.383 --> 00:00:28.824
"I thought you'd stay there forever."

9
00:00:30.224 --> 00:00:31.265
Ivy rolled her eyes.

10
00:00:31.285 --> 00:00:34.786
"Nurse Kramer figured out I was faking it.

11
00:00:35.906 --> 00:00:38.848
I guess I'll be doing the stupid canoe race after all."

12
00:00:40.368 --> 00:00:42.149
Ezra and Glen high-fived each other.

13
00:00:42.169 --> 00:00:44.410
"Yippee for Yellow!"

14
00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:45.410
Glen yelled.

15
00:00:46.311 --> 00:00:47.551
Ivy raised one eyebrow.

16
00:00:47.571 --> 00:00:50.092
"'Yippee for Yellow'?"

17
00:00:50.112 --> 00:00:53.433
"It's our team cheer," Glen said.

18
00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:55.274
"Pretty cool, huh?"

19
00:00:56.475 --> 00:00:57.195
Ivy sighed.

20
00:00:57.215 --> 00:00:59.176
"Pretty awful."

21
00:01:01.632 --> 00:01:04.213
The kids took their trays to a table and sat down.

22
00:01:06.894 --> 00:01:08.234
Ivy put down her backpack.

23
00:01:08.254 --> 00:01:13.695
"Instead of coming up with a cheer, you should have been practicing."

24
00:01:13.716 --> 00:01:18.177
"The Blue team doesn't have Annie anymore," Ezra said.

25
00:01:18.197 --> 00:01:21.218
"So Glen thinks we can beat them.

26
00:01:21.898 --> 00:01:22.818
Maybe he's right."

27
00:01:22.838 --> 00:01:25.419
"Now you're talking!"

28
00:01:26.459 --> 00:01:29.160
Glen raised his glass of bug juice and took a drink.

29
00:01:30.444 --> 00:01:32.306
"But what about the Red team?"

30
00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:34.207
Ezra bit his lip.

31
00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:36.549
"They're really fast too.

32
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:40.533
I'm worried we don't have a chance against them."

33
00:01:40.553 --> 00:01:44.356
"Don't be so negative," Glen said.

34
00:01:44.376 --> 00:01:46.438
"We just need to practice.

35
00:01:47.258 --> 00:01:49.140
Like all day, every day."

36
00:01:50.661 --> 00:01:52.363
He bit into his slice of pizza.

37
00:01:52.383 --> 00:01:55.505
"Right." Ezra nodded.

38
00:01:55.525 --> 00:02:00.621
"Practice all day, every day—for the next ten years."

39
00:02:00.641 --> 00:02:04.343
"I have an idea," Ivy said.

40
00:02:04.363 --> 00:02:06.645
"What if we cheat?"

41
00:02:08.106 --> 00:02:09.346
The boys stared at her.

42
00:02:09.366 --> 00:02:12.128
"Cheat?" Ezra said.

43
00:02:12.148 --> 00:02:15.170
"I don't think so, Ivy.

44
00:02:16.011 --> 00:02:18.852
We'd be mad if the other teams won by cheating."

45
00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:22.855
"Well, I think it's a great idea," Glen said.

46
00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:24.356
"What should we do?"

47
00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.561
Ivy thought as she took a bite of pizza.

48
00:02:30.722 --> 00:02:35.125
"Yuck! This is the greasiest pizza I've ever tasted."

49
00:02:35.145 --> 00:02:37.966
"That's it!"

50
00:02:38.707 --> 00:02:39.807
Glen's eyes lit up.

51
00:02:40.888 --> 00:02:43.730
"Let's grease the other teams' paddles with our pizza slices.

52
00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:47.612
Their paddles will be so slippery, they'll drop them.

53
00:02:48.313 --> 00:02:48.993
And we'll win!"

54
00:02:50.454 --> 00:02:53.596
Glen grabbed the pizza slices from Ivy's and Ezra's plates.

55
00:02:55.928 --> 00:02:57.909
"Hey, I'm still hungry!"

56
00:02:58.310 --> 00:02:58.890
Ezra said.

57
00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:02.472
"You shouldn't eat so much," Glen said.

58
00:03:02.492 --> 00:03:06.155
"And you need to save room for your Colossal Cone."

59
00:03:07.316 --> 00:03:08.316
He glanced around.

60
00:03:12.059 --> 00:03:14.440
have to sneak this pizza down to the lake somehow."

61
00:03:15.621 --> 00:03:17.943
Suddenly he spotted Ivy's backpack.

62
00:03:17.963 --> 00:03:21.965
"No way!"

63
00:03:22.466 --> 00:03:23.006
Ivy said.

64
00:03:23.026 --> 00:03:25.748
"You are not putting pizza in my backpack.

65
00:03:26.516 --> 00:03:27.897
My sketch pad is in there!"

66
00:03:29.418 --> 00:03:30.999
But Glen grabbed it anyway.

67
00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.081
Ivy leaped up to pull it away.

68
00:03:34.942 --> 00:03:37.503
The two of them tugged back and forth on the backpack.

69
00:03:37.523 --> 00:03:41.366
"Glen, stop it," Ezra said.

70
00:03:41.386 --> 00:03:45.329
"Greasing the other teams' paddles isn't a good idea."

71
00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.151
Glen let go and frowned.

72
00:03:48.171 --> 00:03:50.492
"Do you have a better idea?

73
00:03:51.733 --> 00:03:53.354
I'm trying to get us ice cream.

74
00:03:54.155 --> 00:03:55.936
Four scoops of ice cream!

75
00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:57.941
With six toppings!"

76
00:04:00.984 --> 00:04:03.446
Wes Wheezer blew his bugle for the end of lunch.

77
00:04:04.607 --> 00:04:07.349
The kids carried their trays to the pans for washing.

78
00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.551
Then they walked out to the porch.

79
00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:14.495
Ivy wanted to check her mail, but the Ucks came charging toward them.

80
00:04:15.596 --> 00:04:18.679
Buck tossed a basketball, and Huck jumped up to catch it.

81
00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:20.941
He crashed into Ivy.

82
00:04:20.961 --> 00:04:23.103
"Hey, watch it!"

83
00:04:23.543 --> 00:04:24.024
she yelled.

84
00:04:25.568 --> 00:04:26.989
"Why don't you watch it!"

85
00:04:27.389 --> 00:04:27.969
Huck said.

86
00:04:27.989 --> 00:04:31.010
"We need to practice for the free-throw event.

87
00:04:31.991 --> 00:04:33.271
So stay out of our way."

88
00:04:34.032 --> 00:04:35.052
The Ucks ran off.

89
00:04:36.272 --> 00:04:37.153
Ivy scowled.

90
00:04:37.173 --> 00:04:39.714
"I can't stand those Ucks.

91
00:04:40.514 --> 00:04:42.115
Too bad they're not in the canoe race.

92
00:04:43.235 --> 00:04:45.656
They're so big, their canoe would sink!"

93
00:04:46.977 --> 00:04:50.238
"Hmm." Ezra scratched his chin.

94
00:04:50.258 --> 00:04:54.320
"I think I just got an idea of how we could win."
